  "tagline": "A flat-topped sandstone mountain that towers over Cape Town and gets its own cloud 'tablecloth'",
  "intro": "Table Mountain is the flat-topped mountain that forms the backdrop to Cape Town, South Africa, with a level plateau about 3 km (2 mi) from side to side. It sits inside Table Mountain National Park, the most visited national park in South Africa, and was named one of the New7Wonders of Nature in 2011. Visitors reach the top on foot or by a cableway that has run since 1929.",
